      "side": 1,
      "message": "Moving the fragment into `graph/` exposes this route: `get_file_paths` (`blueprints/common.py:17`) walks recursively and appends basenames, so the list still contains `allocation-graphic.html`, and `/visual/allocation-graphic` opens `VISUAL_DIR/allocation-graphic.html` and raises `FileNotFoundError` -\u003e 500. Reproduced with the app test client: PS4 serves that URL with 200, PS5 returns 500. Returning paths relative to `web_path` from `get_file_paths`, or excluding the graph subdirectory here, restores the 404.",
      "revId": "9015e6e900517f37aca3d55ebfa390f6868ff372",
